WEBVTT

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

02:29.649 --> 02:33.153
I have arranged it
with Director Ichiro of Ongseong Hospital.

02:36.531 --> 02:40.577
The child in your womb
will hold a very special meaning

02:40.660 --> 02:45.165
not only to Mr. Ishikawa, but also to me.

02:46.916 --> 02:47.750
That being said…

02:49.878 --> 02:53.256
please take exceptional care of yourself,

02:54.382 --> 02:55.383
Miss Akiko.

03:35.006 --> 03:38.885
Sorry, but we are closed for the day.

04:15.630 --> 04:18.132
The spores stopped floating around
an hour ago.

04:19.926 --> 04:21.010
Has it awakened?

04:22.679 --> 04:24.430
Yes, but it's not moving.

04:25.014 --> 04:27.934
Perhaps we used too much nitrogen gas?

04:33.147 --> 04:34.941
What's on your mind?

04:35.566 --> 04:36.567
Seishin.

04:47.704 --> 04:50.581
Lieutenant Colonel Kato, we have a guest.

04:51.082 --> 04:54.669
This is Lady Maeda.
She is the wife of Commissioner Ishikawa

04:54.752 --> 04:58.006
and the daughter
of Lieutenant General Maeda of the Army.

04:58.506 --> 05:01.926
Outsiders are not allowed down here.

05:02.510 --> 05:06.222
She's also the most generous sponsor
of our hospital, Colonel.

05:18.735 --> 05:19.777
Is that it?

05:22.030 --> 05:24.198
I'd advise you not to get too close.

05:30.997 --> 05:32.040
Seishin.

05:39.839 --> 05:41.841
So you were still alive.

05:43.509 --> 05:46.220
Teacher Seishin.

06:35.728 --> 06:39.065
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN JUSTIFICATION AND EXCUSE

06:39.148 --> 06:41.734
EPISODE 8
AWAKENING

06:45.405 --> 06:47.156
He must have gone through an ordeal.

06:48.449 --> 06:52.495
He hasn't been able to sleep a wink
or swallow a bite of food.

06:54.622 --> 06:55.623
What about Tae-sang?

06:56.124 --> 06:57.542
He didn't make it back.

06:58.042 --> 07:01.212
And the merchants in Bonjeong
have all been arrested.

07:06.134 --> 07:07.218
Yes, hello.

07:07.802 --> 07:08.636
Yes.

07:09.512 --> 07:10.346
Yes.

07:11.973 --> 07:13.808
- Yes, sir.
- Quiet!

07:13.891 --> 07:15.351
Sit down!

07:21.399 --> 07:23.484
Mr. Gu, what's going on?

07:23.985 --> 07:26.112
Why haven't we heard from Master Jang yet?

07:26.779 --> 07:30.366
Is he… not coming to save us?

07:33.119 --> 07:34.120
Is that it?

07:35.246 --> 07:36.289
Damn it!

07:44.338 --> 07:48.801
PAWNSHOP

07:54.390 --> 07:56.726
CLOSED FOR THE DAY

08:21.501 --> 08:22.710
Tae-sang.

08:24.420 --> 08:25.421
What are you up to?

08:27.215 --> 08:28.716
Hurry back home, will you?

08:40.728 --> 08:41.687
Is he dead?

08:44.857 --> 08:46.526
He's breathing, just about.

08:46.609 --> 08:48.861
Take him so he can get treated.

08:49.820 --> 08:51.280
- Hurry.
- Yes, sir!

08:57.620 --> 09:00.081
Kill him…

09:07.088 --> 09:08.047
Find…

09:10.591 --> 09:12.051
the bastard

09:13.761 --> 09:15.930
and kill him!

10:33.132 --> 10:35.468
All of you, stop and stand back!

10:55.321 --> 10:56.364
As you were.

11:11.128 --> 11:13.798
Sir! I have something to report.

11:17.718 --> 11:18.803
Is it urgent?

11:18.886 --> 11:21.305
First Sergeant Haneda
was found next to the body dump.

11:21.389 --> 11:22.890
He has a serious gunshot wound.

11:24.350 --> 11:28.521
My apologies, Lady Maeda.
Would you wait inside for just a moment?

12:06.308 --> 12:07.309
Mr. Jang!

12:09.395 --> 12:11.689
What are you… doing here?

12:12.398 --> 12:14.150
I came in to do a job

12:15.526 --> 12:17.361
but missed my chance to leave.

12:19.405 --> 12:20.573
So I need you

12:21.699 --> 12:23.659
to help me, Lady Maeda.

12:29.874 --> 12:33.544
Are you saying that a Josenjing
is still hiding in here?

12:33.627 --> 12:35.504
Yes, sir. It seems so.

12:35.588 --> 12:36.797
Director Ichiro!

12:38.674 --> 12:40.760
The Josenjing seems to be in this wing.

12:40.843 --> 12:43.929
This soldier just found blood
near the supply room.

12:53.856 --> 12:55.316
Lady Maeda, I'm afraid

12:56.108 --> 12:57.860
now is not a good time…

13:06.577 --> 13:08.037
It's an emergency! Emergency!

13:08.621 --> 13:09.997
Lady Maeda is in danger!

13:10.080 --> 13:13.959
Find Lady Maeda immediately! Now!

13:36.690 --> 13:37.858
Lady Maeda.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.541
No questions. Just drive.

14:17.857 --> 14:18.774
Go.

14:30.286 --> 14:31.412
Thank you.

14:45.467 --> 14:48.053
What should I do, ma'am? Shall I stop?

15:11.118 --> 15:12.119
To Bonjeong.

15:27.426 --> 15:31.722
PAWNSHOP
CLOSED FOR THE DAY

16:22.398 --> 16:24.149
Were you at Golden Treasure again?

16:29.655 --> 16:30.823
Waiting for me?

16:32.574 --> 16:34.201
It's been four days.

16:35.035 --> 16:37.121
The fact that he hasn't reached out

16:38.038 --> 16:39.957
means it's unlikely for him to return.

16:41.083 --> 16:44.586
Besides, our job was to find Myeong-ja.

16:44.670 --> 16:48.757
Since we've done our part,
it is time for us to head back home.

16:51.176 --> 16:53.470
Get ready to leave early tomorrow morning.

16:54.179 --> 16:55.889
I should have stayed in his place.

16:57.683 --> 16:59.685
It was his choice.

16:59.768 --> 17:02.938
All he had to do was save Myeong-ja, but…

17:05.858 --> 17:06.775
because of us…

17:08.777 --> 17:11.905
I should've stayed
and found a way to rescue Mother.

17:13.365 --> 17:16.910
I should've at least gotten revenge
on those who did that to her.

17:19.872 --> 17:22.666
Then he wouldn't have been left alone.

17:24.209 --> 17:26.670
And I wouldn't be wracked with guilt.

17:28.714 --> 17:30.049
What do you mean by that?

17:36.889 --> 17:38.432
I met Mother.

17:41.769 --> 17:42.770
She's still there…

17:45.981 --> 17:47.524
at Ongseong Hospital.

18:02.081 --> 18:04.750
It's been in that state
ever since Lady Maeda's visit.

18:05.501 --> 18:08.128
It seems to be enraged by something.

18:10.255 --> 18:11.924
It's looking for its young.

18:13.509 --> 18:14.343
Sir?

18:14.426 --> 18:15.969
It's not enraged,

18:16.845 --> 18:18.097
but agitated.

20:20.719 --> 20:21.762
I'll ask again.

20:22.638 --> 20:24.806
Where are the Josenjings
you helped escape?

20:27.351 --> 20:28.810
I don't know.

20:30.395 --> 20:31.897
Where is Jang Tae-sang right now?

20:32.856 --> 20:33.815
I wish…

20:36.109 --> 20:37.611
I wish I knew.

20:41.573 --> 20:43.158
You don't seem to understand.

20:44.243 --> 20:45.577
Should we start over?

20:48.747 --> 20:49.998
Over…

20:50.540 --> 20:54.002
Start… over…

21:01.093 --> 21:02.511
Have you ever had

21:03.679 --> 21:05.639
your nails plucked out?

21:10.310 --> 21:11.853
Have you ever been burned…

21:17.776 --> 21:20.112
or gone through electric torture?

21:24.491 --> 21:26.660
Do you know what happens

21:27.244 --> 21:30.163
when water mixed with chili powder
is poured down your nose

21:30.831 --> 21:32.416
while hanging upside down?

21:35.002 --> 21:36.128
Persist to that point,

21:36.753 --> 21:39.548
and a person can no longer remain human.

21:41.133 --> 21:43.051
If you're ever in such a situation,

21:44.136 --> 21:46.471
don't try to hold back and ruin your life.

21:46.555 --> 21:48.390
Just tell them everything you know.

21:49.057 --> 21:53.770
I won't ever resent you for betraying me
in a situation like that.

21:54.521 --> 21:55.772
Keep that in mind.

21:58.900 --> 21:59.985
Let me ask you again.

22:00.736 --> 22:02.779
What is the true purpose of your pawnshop?

22:03.280 --> 22:04.281
Are you rebels?

22:05.157 --> 22:07.326
Or do you secretly fund
the independence army?

22:09.870 --> 22:11.038
Answer me!

22:12.247 --> 22:15.334
Where is Jang Tae-sang?

22:28.055 --> 22:29.931
Goddamn it…

22:56.041 --> 22:57.042
You are awake.

23:00.212 --> 23:01.129
Lady Maeda.

23:20.023 --> 23:21.942
Your fever has gone down, thankfully.

23:22.025 --> 23:24.694
Your wounds are also healing well.

23:29.491 --> 23:32.786
How long have I been here?

23:34.287 --> 23:36.331
As of today, it's been four days.

23:41.128 --> 23:45.424
You caused quite a stir
at Ongseong Hospital.

23:48.176 --> 23:51.304
Though you didn't need to risk your life
over someone else's trouble.

23:52.097 --> 23:53.557
It's not like you.

23:59.646 --> 24:00.689
It just

24:02.023 --> 24:03.275
made me a bit angry.

24:05.569 --> 24:08.572
It's not my fault that this country
has come to this.

24:11.074 --> 24:14.703
It's not my fault those people
were kept in there and suffering, but…

24:18.373 --> 24:19.374
But?

24:20.500 --> 24:21.418
But…

24:23.462 --> 24:25.547
once I saw it with my own eyes,

24:26.923 --> 24:28.049
it made me angry.

24:29.468 --> 24:30.802
It pissed me off.

24:31.761 --> 24:35.765
Could you not stand the injustice
as a fellow Joseon person?

24:38.768 --> 24:40.395
No, I couldn't stand it

24:41.563 --> 24:43.148
as a fellow human being.

24:45.233 --> 24:49.696
Do you think all human lives are equal?

24:52.199 --> 24:54.159
Do you somehow think they're not?

25:00.665 --> 25:01.666
Do you still

25:03.001 --> 25:05.378
consider us friends?

25:24.189 --> 25:25.357
A serial murder case?

25:25.440 --> 25:28.944
Yes, 11 deaths around Cheonggyecheon
over the past four days.

25:29.027 --> 25:31.154
We've requested the military ward
for autopsies.

25:31.238 --> 25:34.449
An unusually large number of corpses
were in a very strange state.

25:34.533 --> 25:36.743
Strange? In what way?

25:37.410 --> 25:40.288
They were missing their brains, sir.

26:14.823 --> 26:16.783
He's from the military ward.

26:32.340 --> 26:34.009
This is the House of Golden Treasure!

26:34.718 --> 26:35.802
No.

26:36.595 --> 26:38.388
We haven't put the store up for sale.

26:40.682 --> 26:42.058
What are you talking about?

26:44.019 --> 26:44.936
Dead…

26:45.854 --> 26:47.522
What do you mean? Who's dead?

26:48.940 --> 26:51.276
Just who do you think you are?

26:51.359 --> 26:54.237
You watch your mouth
and the crap that comes out of it!

26:54.779 --> 26:57.949
That's right, you heard me! Oh, pipe down!

26:59.034 --> 27:01.995
Shut your trap,
or I will sew it shut for you.

27:05.957 --> 27:07.500
Like they know it all.

27:07.584 --> 27:11.004
How dare they say shit like he's dead
as if they have a say in it?

27:22.474 --> 27:24.476
You've got to be freaking kidding me.

27:31.441 --> 27:32.776
House of Golden Treasure.

27:34.986 --> 27:38.907
I believe my employee
has already answered that question.

27:40.116 --> 27:41.117
Me?

27:42.661 --> 27:44.204
I'm the master of this shop,

27:45.997 --> 27:47.165
Jang Tae-sang.

27:51.419 --> 27:52.253
Yes.

27:52.754 --> 27:54.756
I'm still alive and well.

27:59.177 --> 28:03.431
More people have been eyeing up
my treasured shop lately, haven't they?

28:05.433 --> 28:07.310
Tae-sang, you…

28:08.311 --> 28:09.396
Look what you've done.

28:09.938 --> 28:13.108
You didn't have to close up shop.
I was only gone for a few days.

28:13.608 --> 28:15.610
No wonder they got the wrong idea.

28:16.945 --> 28:17.862
Are…

28:19.864 --> 28:21.116
Are you all right?

28:22.742 --> 28:23.660
Of course I am.

28:27.414 --> 28:30.208
You're not hurt?

28:30.291 --> 28:31.793
Of course not!

28:32.627 --> 28:33.628
Fool!

28:34.212 --> 28:36.840
If you're okay,
then what took you so long?

28:36.923 --> 28:39.884
Did you enjoy giving this old woman
a heart attack?

28:39.968 --> 28:42.303
You heartless boy!

28:42.387 --> 28:43.930
Hey, I'm sorry.

28:44.013 --> 28:45.390
I had my reasons!

28:47.517 --> 28:48.768
So calm down, Mrs. Nawol.

28:54.733 --> 28:56.151
I said I was sorry.

28:58.653 --> 28:59.946
Enough of this.

29:01.990 --> 29:05.118
You should go and fetch Mr. Gu now.

29:11.708 --> 29:12.709
Where is he?

29:56.836 --> 29:57.670
Get up.

30:03.927 --> 30:05.345
No! I won't go!

30:06.679 --> 30:07.847
Get out!

30:16.314 --> 30:17.148
Master Jang!

30:37.544 --> 30:38.878
Wait here.

30:40.088 --> 30:41.464
Stop right there!

30:42.173 --> 30:43.925
Where do you think you're going?

30:47.387 --> 30:49.138
Is that Jang from Golden Treasure?

30:54.853 --> 30:56.771
I'm here to see Commissioner Ishikawa.

30:56.855 --> 31:00.066
Hey, you! Are you ignoring me?

31:01.568 --> 31:03.319
Go tell him I'm here.

31:03.403 --> 31:04.988
You insolent bastard!

31:07.198 --> 31:09.117
Swinging a fist at someone

31:09.200 --> 31:12.161
who's come to have a conversation
is what thugs do.

31:16.374 --> 31:20.628
If you're a police officer,
why don't you act like one?

31:35.351 --> 31:37.604
You caused a bigger scene than I expected.

31:39.522 --> 31:41.733
Only because you told me to do
whatever it took.

31:43.234 --> 31:44.068
So,

31:44.903 --> 31:48.573
what did you do with the Joseon people
you helped escape?

31:51.284 --> 31:53.536
Which Joseon people are you referring to?

31:55.705 --> 32:00.501
Like I said, I'm here as a representative
of the Bonjeong Merchants Association.

32:00.585 --> 32:03.838
I'm asking you to release
the wrongfully imprisoned merchants.

32:06.341 --> 32:09.010
No less than ten violations
were committed that night.

32:09.886 --> 32:11.846
Loud singing, jazz-playing,

32:11.930 --> 32:15.892
violation of public order
and security regulations, et cetera.

32:16.476 --> 32:18.061
Let's settle this with a fine.

32:18.144 --> 32:20.438
Do you think money
will fix this situation?

32:20.521 --> 32:23.066
It's the cleanest and easiest way,
isn't it?

32:25.860 --> 32:26.861
And if I refuse?

32:27.695 --> 32:31.366
Then all businesses in Bonjeong
will close up starting today.

32:33.201 --> 32:36.537
You know that the fundraising party
for the war effort will be held

32:36.621 --> 32:37.705
in two days.

32:38.289 --> 32:42.251
All deliveries of food and drinks
to the party will be stopped.

32:42.961 --> 32:46.965
Plus, all the officials and their wives
who have put in orders for their garments

32:47.048 --> 32:49.342
will not be able to receive them in time.

32:50.969 --> 32:54.013
When that happens,
the authorities will begin to investigate.

32:55.056 --> 32:57.392
That would put you in a tight spot,
would it not?

32:58.810 --> 32:59.727
Is that a threat?

33:01.729 --> 33:04.232
When there comes a time
for the weak to be strong,

33:05.149 --> 33:06.734
we do something called "unite."

33:07.735 --> 33:11.656
We are simply doing what we can do
in light of the situation.

33:13.116 --> 33:14.367
Know your limits.

33:15.618 --> 33:18.538
Don't risk your life
for matters that don't concern you.

33:24.127 --> 33:28.297
I learned an important lesson
from my visit to Ongseong Hospital.

33:29.674 --> 33:31.634
When you need to risk your life,

33:32.427 --> 33:33.511
you go all in.

33:35.263 --> 33:37.098
If you hesitate to do so,

33:38.558 --> 33:39.767
you'll end up dead.

33:42.478 --> 33:46.232
I know the prime suspects
in this incident.

33:48.109 --> 33:50.528
Jang Tae-sang
of the House of Golden Treasure,

33:50.611 --> 33:53.156
Yoon Chae-ok the sleuth, and…

33:54.407 --> 33:57.618
a Joseon courtesan named Akiko.

34:05.501 --> 34:06.836
Miss Akiko?

34:08.087 --> 34:08.921
Are you okay?

34:16.637 --> 34:20.892
Do you have reasons to believe
that they are suspects?

34:20.975 --> 34:23.728
The suspects I've just mentioned

34:23.811 --> 34:27.565
all entered Ongseong Hospital
and then escaped.

34:28.316 --> 34:31.611
What exactly happened at the hospital?

34:31.694 --> 34:34.280
I'm not inclined
to divulge that information.

34:34.906 --> 34:36.532
It's a military secret.

34:44.165 --> 34:45.083
Akiko.

34:49.420 --> 34:50.254
Aki…

35:20.118 --> 35:21.452
What in the hell…

35:26.874 --> 35:27.708
Tell me.

35:29.127 --> 35:30.711
What went on in there?

35:32.880 --> 35:37.093
What exactly is happening
inside Ongseong Hospital?!

35:41.806 --> 35:42.890
As you know,

35:43.724 --> 35:45.935
the price for my information
is quite steep.

35:46.894 --> 35:49.105
And confidentiality
about Ongseong Hospital

35:49.188 --> 35:52.233
is considered to be
of the highest level, you know.

35:53.025 --> 35:57.196
I can only hand over such information
when enough trust has been built.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.990
Are you trying to strike a deal?

35:59.073 --> 36:00.533
Mr. Ishikawa!

36:00.616 --> 36:03.494
I'm trying to talk about mutual trust.

36:04.996 --> 36:06.956
I have already kept my promise

36:07.582 --> 36:09.167
and returned Akiko to you.

36:11.752 --> 36:13.296
Now it's your turn.

36:15.381 --> 36:17.049
Release my people.

36:31.647 --> 36:32.815
Get out!

36:33.608 --> 36:35.067
You're all released!

36:35.151 --> 36:36.986
Released! We're free!

37:13.397 --> 37:14.482
Master Jang…

37:18.152 --> 37:19.403
You're alive?

37:23.908 --> 37:25.117
Can you stand up?

37:27.370 --> 37:29.288
What took you so long?

37:40.758 --> 37:42.176
Let's get out of here first.

37:45.596 --> 37:46.597
Come on.

37:49.976 --> 37:56.190
Bonjeong!

37:56.774 --> 37:58.609
Do you all want to die?

37:59.527 --> 38:00.736
Be quiet!

38:14.542 --> 38:19.922
Bonjeong.

38:32.643 --> 38:34.228
- Mori.
- Yes!

38:35.479 --> 38:36.314
Commissioner, sir.

38:36.397 --> 38:38.607
Keep Jang under close observation
from now on.

38:39.191 --> 38:41.444
Pardon? Again, sir?

38:44.488 --> 38:45.489
Understood, sir.

38:51.579 --> 38:54.707
MILITARY WARD, UNDERGROUND LAB
HUMAN EXPERIMENTS, LADY MAEDA

38:58.711 --> 39:02.256
LADY MAEDA

39:18.356 --> 39:20.858
Don't worry too much. He'll be all right.

39:22.651 --> 39:26.322
I owe Mr. Gu too great a debt.

39:26.405 --> 39:27.406
Hardly.

39:28.366 --> 39:31.327
I can't even count
all the times you saved his life.

39:32.203 --> 39:34.038
He just repaid you for one of them.

39:41.712 --> 39:43.214
The aftermath of torture…

39:45.341 --> 39:46.592
lasts a while, huh?

39:50.304 --> 39:51.472
You should go now.

39:54.600 --> 39:56.685
No, I'll stay here.

39:56.769 --> 39:59.146
There is someone else waiting for you.

40:02.900 --> 40:04.443
She came by every single day

40:05.653 --> 40:08.155
to check whether you had returned safely.

40:09.782 --> 40:11.117
Leave Mr. Gu to me.

40:11.784 --> 40:13.536
Go pay her a visit.

40:52.283 --> 40:54.201
Aren't you having dinner?

40:54.285 --> 40:55.369
I'm not hungry.

40:56.412 --> 40:57.788
You go and eat.

40:57.872 --> 41:00.124
Should I grab some dumplings for you?

41:03.711 --> 41:05.171
I'll be right back.

42:03.771 --> 42:04.855
Who are you?

42:21.539 --> 42:23.415
You're still as aggressive as ever.

42:31.382 --> 42:33.133
Now that you've seen my face,

42:34.051 --> 42:35.219
will you let me go?

42:42.059 --> 42:43.352
Master Jang…

43:16.510 --> 43:17.761
I felt the same way.

43:21.265 --> 43:22.182
I also…

43:25.019 --> 43:26.478
missed you a lot.

43:57.760 --> 43:59.136
Did you have something to say?

43:59.219 --> 44:00.471
Tell me.

44:02.806 --> 44:05.643
How much do you know
about the underground laboratory

44:06.644 --> 44:08.145
in Ongseong Hospital?

44:13.734 --> 44:17.321
Are you even remotely aware
of what exactly is going on there?

44:17.404 --> 44:19.615
There is nothing I don't know about.

44:23.911 --> 44:25.579
What have you done to Akiko?

44:30.918 --> 44:32.920
I asked you what you did to her!

44:33.003 --> 44:35.923
You seem to be mistaken.

44:37.091 --> 44:40.511
You have no right to ask me such things.

44:41.804 --> 44:44.056
And I have no obligation to answer you.

44:44.807 --> 44:45.724
What's that now?

44:45.808 --> 44:51.271
From the beginning, our relationship
was formed for mutual benefit.

44:52.690 --> 44:56.402
I needed a husband
so I could come to Joseon.

44:57.778 --> 45:04.159
And you needed my good name and lineage
to move up and succeed.

45:05.494 --> 45:09.456
You suddenly assuming
the role of my husband like this

45:10.290 --> 45:13.711
puts me in an awkward position,
Mr. Ishikawa.

45:16.296 --> 45:18.382
You shouldn't have touched Akiko.

45:20.217 --> 45:24.471
And you had no need
to send Mr. Jang in there.

45:24.555 --> 45:27.641
We agreed not to interfere
in each other's personal lives.

45:27.725 --> 45:30.394
You're the one who broke the agreement
in the first place!

45:31.061 --> 45:33.355
I respect what you do for a pastime.

45:34.481 --> 45:36.692
But having a child

45:37.901 --> 45:40.070
is a completely different story.

45:50.122 --> 45:54.126
Did you know that Jang Tae-sang
found himself a woman?

46:00.382 --> 46:03.886
A Joseon woman named Yoon Chae-ok.

46:04.803 --> 46:07.765
Apparently, she's young and pretty.

46:09.933 --> 46:11.435
How unfortunate for you.

46:12.603 --> 46:15.647
All that effort nursing him back to health

46:16.774 --> 46:18.150
was absolutely in vain.

47:55.706 --> 47:57.374
Here are your dumplings.

48:09.720 --> 48:11.054
Let's get going.

48:14.892 --> 48:16.727
What a fool!

49:00.896 --> 49:01.980
Stop.

49:12.115 --> 49:14.242
Go… go away!

49:14.326 --> 49:16.286
Get away from me!

50:05.836 --> 50:07.754
Myeong-ja?

50:22.185 --> 50:25.856
So, these are the Najin?

50:25.939 --> 50:27.107
Correct.

50:28.525 --> 50:31.611
They were found inside the glaciers
of Muryong Snow Mountain,

50:31.695 --> 50:33.530
where the Na people live.

50:33.613 --> 50:37.701
And you're saying
that this enters the human brain

50:37.784 --> 50:40.871
to create creatures like Seishin?

50:41.872 --> 50:42.706
No.

50:44.291 --> 50:48.462
With Najin alone,
it only turns them into predators.

50:50.839 --> 50:52.799
While retaining the appearance of a human,

50:53.383 --> 50:56.094
they will hold only the survival
and hunting instincts,

50:56.887 --> 50:59.723
and prey primarily on human brains.

51:33.381 --> 51:38.637
Highly aggressive and more violent
than most predatory animals,

51:38.720 --> 51:41.973
they can move quickly
and heal wounds almost immediately.

51:48.897 --> 51:52.651
Then why does Seishin
appear the way she does?

51:52.734 --> 51:56.947
Because she was injected with a serum
that contained anthrax.

52:24.182 --> 52:27.853
Once injected with this serum
during their predatory stage,

52:27.936 --> 52:30.230
they will move on to Seishin's phase.

52:30.981 --> 52:33.733
Do they have any weaknesses?

52:43.326 --> 52:44.744
They hate sunlight and fire,

52:45.954 --> 52:47.706
and they are weak against nitrogen.

53:10.395 --> 53:11.980
Get a hold of yourself.

53:12.606 --> 53:13.773
Why are you doing this?

53:14.858 --> 53:16.026
Myeong-ja!

53:23.366 --> 53:24.826
How horrid.

53:26.036 --> 53:30.248
To remember what it was like
to be human, even in that state…

53:31.875 --> 53:32.959
Ongseong Hospital.

53:34.544 --> 53:36.546
They must've experimented on her.

54:00.987 --> 54:03.448
A flare was fired from Jongno, sir!

54:21.925 --> 54:23.593
Over there! Get her!

54:32.269 --> 54:33.353
Stop!

55:04.426 --> 55:05.969
Don't lose her. Get her!

55:06.052 --> 55:06.970
Yes, sir!

55:30.910 --> 55:35.248
It was not able to remember at first,
not until it met its daughter.

55:37.792 --> 55:38.960
Daughter?

55:40.170 --> 55:43.590
Seishin has… a daughter?

55:44.174 --> 55:49.220
She snuck in here, looking for her mother
who had gone missing ten years ago.

55:50.055 --> 55:52.891
When it recognized its daughter, it…

55:54.684 --> 55:56.519
flipped a switch, I think.

55:57.103 --> 55:59.439
And her daughter's name is…

55:59.522 --> 56:01.107
Yoon Chae-ok.

56:03.026 --> 56:04.486
She works as a sleuth.

56:06.988 --> 56:08.323
Did you know

56:08.406 --> 56:10.492
that Jang Tae-sang found himself a woman?

56:11.034 --> 56:14.579
A Joseon woman named Yoon Chae-ok.

56:19.542 --> 56:20.960
- Find her!
- Yes, sir!

56:21.044 --> 56:22.212
- This way too!
- Yes, sir!

56:22.295 --> 56:23.838
- Hurry up!
- This way!

56:23.922 --> 56:25.256
- Move!
- Find her!

56:57.372 --> 56:59.040
That way! Get her!

57:12.470 --> 57:13.304
Are you all right?

57:13.388 --> 57:15.390
If she's caught, she might get killed.

57:16.850 --> 57:19.185
No, she will go through much worse.

57:20.562 --> 57:21.521
Like my mother did.

57:24.482 --> 57:25.483
Go after her!

57:30.989 --> 57:32.073
Run!

57:33.450 --> 57:34.617
Catch her!

57:52.218 --> 57:53.219
Go.

58:01.019 --> 58:02.479
Don't kill me…

58:03.313 --> 58:04.772
Please don't kill me!

58:07.025 --> 58:08.276
Please don't…

58:14.908 --> 58:16.034
Hold it!

58:16.993 --> 58:18.411
That way!

58:30.006 --> 58:31.257
Find her!

58:31.341 --> 58:32.425
Don't lose her!

58:32.509 --> 58:33.843
Stop right there!

58:41.684 --> 58:42.977
Don't kill me…

58:45.104 --> 58:46.648
Please don't kill me!

58:47.941 --> 58:49.651
Please don't kill me…

58:50.360 --> 58:51.778
Don't kill me!
